"These advanced LightGallery.js plugins are available in the Pro version "
"with additional customization options."
msgstr ""
"Plugin LightGallery.js lanjutan ini tersedia di versi Pro dengan opsi "
"kustomisasi tambahan."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3704 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3705
